# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Frontend configuration
#
#   cp frontend/.env.example  frontend/.env.local
#   then fill in the values you want and restart `npm run dev`
#
# .env.local is gitignored. .env.example is committed, so it must
# never contain a real key.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Basemaps ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Nothing to configure. The map uses Esri and OpenStreetMap basemaps,
# which are free for non-commercial use and need no API key.
#
# CARTO is deliberately NOT supported: its free tier is vector-only,
# and its raster tiles return an "API KEY REQUIRED" watermark even
# with a valid key. See src/lib/basemaps.js for the measurements.

# ── API location — OPTIONAL ───────────────────────────────────
#
# The dev proxy reads API_PORT from the repo-root .env, so normally
# you do not need to set anything here. Override only if the API runs
# somewhere unusual.
#
# VITE_API_PORT=5001
# VITE_API_TARGET=http://localhost:5001
